-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">4.</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">대기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">,&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">공공기관 등 재직자는 지원 제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 28.8px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">5.&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">졸업 후&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">1</font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">년 소속기업에서 의무근무&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">필수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 28.8px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 40); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">6.&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"color: rgb